+DEF("analysis-capabilities", HAS_ARG, QEMU_OPTION_analysis_capabilities,
+    "-analysis-capabilities vanilla|analysis,fuzz,rr,guest-hypercall,handoff\n"
+    "                provision startup extensions (default: vanilla/zero)\n",
+    QEMU_ARCH_ALL)
+SRST
+``-analysis-capabilities names``
+    Provision a comma-separated list of startup capabilities. ``fuzz`` and ``rr``
+    also provision ``analysis``. ``vanilla`` selects zero capabilities and must
+    appear alone. Unknown or empty names are errors. Repeated options replace
+    the preceding selection. Selection freezes before board initialization.
+    This initial policy gates guest hypercall encodings and the x86 hypercall
+    port; it does not yet provide complete upstream vanilla behavior parity.
+ERST
